cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SeekerCraft (Craft-Agent)"
abstract: >-
  An LLM-driven autonomous Minecraft bot (Rust + Azalea protocol client) that
  observes structured game state, plans multi-step survival strategies, and
  executes them through typed tools, with the goal of beating the Ender Dragon.
  Includes a 13-step agent loop, 49 LLM tools, 23 structured tasks, reactive
  modes, spatial world memory, and a probe-based tool test harness.
keywords:
